  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Mini Purple Heaven a faint purple light shines in the haziness. In that vast sky floats the heavenly crystal eagle nest, a nest like a three-storey crystal building with no doors or windows.",
      "chapters": [
        1115
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The heavenly crystal eagle nest is eaten by the upper extreme heavenly eagle, leaving only an upper extreme heavenly eagle egg and some heavenly crystal fragments exchanged from Lang Ya land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "nest-remnants",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mini Purple Heaven holds the upper extreme heavenly eagle at desolate beast strength, and more than eighty eagle nests float there as loot from Iron Eagle blessed land. The original heavenly crystal eagle nest has already been fully eaten by the upper extreme heavenly eagle.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eagle-nests-and-eagle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Groups of desolate and ancient desolate eagles live in Mini Purple Heaven. Fang Yuan bought them by selling Immortal Gu during the dream realm incident, used them to help enslave the upper extreme heavenly eagle, and raises them in the eagle nests taken from Hei tribe’s headquarters, though those nests are not as amazing as the heavenly crystal eagle nest.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eagle-groups",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A mission board entry reports that within Mini Purple Heaven a large number of ancient desolate beast mixed heavenly eagles have turned into immemorial desolate beasts for unknown reasons, and asks investigators to find the truth.",
      "chapters": [
        2242
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
